## 🔄 2. Waterfall, Agile, and DevOps

| Approach | Main Focus |
|---|---|
| **Waterfall** | Work organised into sequential phases |
| **Agile** | Small iterations and frequent feedback |
| **DevOps** | Collaboration across software delivery and operation |

Agile and DevOps can work together: a team can develop in short iterations while automating how changes are tested and delivered.

