## 📦 5. Important Terms

| Term | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| **Repository** | Stores source code and its version history | A Git repository |
| **Build** | Prepares runnable or distributable application output | Building a React application |
| **Artifact** | An output that can be stored, tested, or deployed | A `dist` folder or container image |
| **Pipeline** | An organised sequence of automated steps | Test → build → deploy |
| **Staging** | An environment for validation before production | A test deployment of a booking app |
| **Production** | The environment used by real users | A live rental website |
| **Deployment** | Places an application version into an environment | Deploying an API to a server |

